1
00:00:03,193 --> 00:00:06,581
Open Load Activities, and add an Automatic load.

2
00:00:06,581 --> 00:00:09,091
Pick the Subject and the Campaign.

3
00:00:09,091 --> 00:00:09,970
The A.I.

4
00:00:09,970 --> 00:00:14,613
profile is chosen here, because an outbound subject cannot hold one.

5
00:00:15,068 --> 00:00:16,603
Channel is Phone.

6
00:00:16,603 --> 00:00:19,672
Address is the number the customer sees.

7
00:00:19,672 --> 00:00:24,475
Without an address, the Telnyx default outbound caller ID is used.

8
00:00:24,475 --> 00:00:28,678
Schedule at holds the first call until a time you choose.

9
00:00:29,132 --> 00:00:31,381
Save and load the activities.

10
00:00:31,381 --> 00:00:37,552
They wait as automated activities, and the background task starts each one when it is due.

